{"ref":"BDB, יִלּוֹד","hw":"יִלּוֹד","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יִלּוֹד</span></big>  <strong>adj. born (</strong>irreg. punctuation for <span dir=\"rtl\">יָלוּד</span>, Dr <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 5:14\" href=\"/II_Samuel.5.14\">2 S 5:14</a><strong>)</strong>,—<span dir=\"rtl\">יִלּוֹד</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 1:22\" href=\"/Exodus.1.22\">Ex 1:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 12:14\" href=\"/II_Samuel.12.14\">2 S 12:14</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יִלֹּדִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 5:5\" href=\"/Joshua.5.5\">Jos 5:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 5:14\" href=\"/II_Samuel.5.14\">2 S 5:14</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יִלּוֹדִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 16:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.16.3\">Je 16:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">הַבֵּן הַיִּלּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 1:22\" href=\"/Exodus.1.22\">Ex 1:22</a> (E) <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 12:14\" href=\"/II_Samuel.12.14\">2 S 12:14</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">לְךָ</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">הָעָם הַיִּלּ׳ בַּמִּדְבָּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 5:5\" href=\"/Joshua.5.5\">Jos 5:5</a> (D); <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל־הַבָּנִים וְעַל־הַבָּנוֹת הַיִּלּוֹדִים בַּמָּקוֹם הַזֶּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 16:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.16.3\">Je 16:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">הַיִּלּוֹדִים לוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 5:14\" href=\"/II_Samuel.5.14\">2 S 5:14</a>.","next":"BDB, יָלִיד","prev":"BDB, יַלְדוּת"}